I can help with that, but I can't invent a "place for every character of the alphabet" as if it were a complete lore list, because vanilla WoW doesn't provide a clean one-to-one mapping for every letter. What I can do is give you a solid vanilla-WoW-based set, starting with A, and mark the letters that don't have a natural single-place answer.

A — Azeroth  
B — Barrens  
C — Durotar  
D — Darkshore  
E — Elwynn Forest  
F — Feralas  
G — Gilneas  
H — Hillsbrad Foothills  
I — (no strong single vanilla place; closest is the Isle of Quel'Delar, but that's not a clean "I")  
J — (no vanilla place starting with J)  
K — (no vanilla place starting with K)  
L — (no vanilla place starting with L)  
M — (no vanilla place starting with M)  
N — (no vanilla place starting with N)  
O — (no vanilla place starting with O)  
P — (no vanilla place starting with P)  
Q — Quel'Delar  
R — (no vanilla place starting with R)  
S — (no vanilla place starting with S)  
T — (no vanilla place starting with T)  
U — (no vanilla place starting with U)  
V — (no vanilla place starting with V)  
